{"id":"wb-5-348","name":"奉仙观","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"奉仙观","text":"奉仙观位于中国河南省济源市北海街道荆梁北街，因主体建筑三清大殿用荆木作梁，故又称“荆梁观”，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n奉仙观始建于唐垂拱元年（685年），唐代二鲁真人（鲁希言、鲁和光）和宋代贺兰栖曾在此修道。现存金、明、清建筑十座，整体建筑坐北朝南，长90.5米，宽45.5米。山门为清代所建，面阔三间，进深二间，单檐悬山顶。玉皇殿建于明代，面阔三间，进深四架椽，单檐悬山顶。三清大殿建于金大定二十四年（1184年），面阔五间，进深七架椽，单檐悬山顶，是减柱造建筑的典型。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A5%89%E4%BB%99%E8%A7%82","revisionId":93688009,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93688009","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3993a61be928a1e625d96a13.jpg","title":"20260620_Fengxian_Guan_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260620_Fengxian_Guan_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/20260620_Fengxian_Guan_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​济源 奉仙观三清大殿","width":320,"height":213}}